  "notes": "POS back-office 'Orders' screen. Electric blue (#3248ff) used sparingly: active nav pill (light-blue bg #e8ebff), the active segmented button, selected order row (light blue fill + blue outline), customer strip tint. Pastel status pills (yellow Pending, blue Preparing, green Ready, red Unpaid, orange 'Couch' table tag). Detail panel has light gray header band, then customer strip, line items with small colored status dot, modifiers line ('+ Gluten-free bread'), inline edit/price-override/void icon buttons, subtotal/tax/total block, and a bottom-anchored action bar with solid black Checkout and green-outlined Add Item. Thin footer status bar shows staff role, printer connection (green), 'Shift opened' pill and Diagnostics & Logs. Lucide-style line icons."
